* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# @glyphs-ai/sdk commits a codegenned fetch client whose source of truth is
# the OpenAPI spec, not hand edits. Mark it linguist-generated so GitHub
# folds it in PR diffs and drops it from language stats; `-diff` also skips
# it in local `git diff`. Drift is still caught: `git diff --exit-code`
# reports a binary change and exits non-zero when the tree is stale.
packages/sdk/src/generated/** linguist-generated=true -diff
